  "notes": "{怒鳴|どな}る specifically implies angry shouting, as opposed to neutral loud speaking.\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ⟦{叫|さけ}ぶ→叫ぶ：02108_sakebu⟧: to scream, to shout (neutral, not necessarily angry)\n- ⟦{喚|わめ}く→喚く：05345_wameku⟧: to yell, to scream (often hysterical or out of control)\n- ⟦{怒|おこ}る→怒る：00876_okoru⟧: to get angry (doesn't necessarily involve shouting)\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- 〜⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{怒鳴|どな}る: to yell at ~\n- {怒鳴|どな}り⟦{声|こえ}→声：02207_koe⟧ (どなりごえ): yelling voice\n- {怒鳴|どな}りつける: to yell at fiercely",
